est to get are at the top, because a harder seat placed below an easier one can never be allotted. The best signs come from 2025 Round 3 closings: Healthworld closed at 42,526, Civil Hospital Aizawl at 41,360 (OBC) and CIHSR at 41,221.\n- **Lines 13–18 (government MD, All India quota):** these are long shots. They reached your rank only in 2025 stray rounds, for example Tezpur at 47,659 and NAMO at 48,136. All of them have bonds, such as NAMO's 3 years with a ₹50 L penalty.\n- **Lines 19–27 (deemed MD):** this is your strongest group. Closings in 2026 Round 1 ranged from 45,083 at KMC Manipal to 91,120 at SUM. The catch: **once one of these seats is open at your rank, MCC won't get to lines 28–30.** Keep the Family Medicine lines there only if you really would join a deemed MD seat over them.\n- **What I left out to stay at 30:** SBKS (₹40.42 L), Sri Ramachandra (₹32 L), Amrita (no clear seats) and VELS (reached only in Round 3), all deemed. I also left out seats with no past allotments or unknown terms, like GMC Osmanabad.\n\n**Check before you fill**\n- **Deemed seats:** from Round 2 on, not joining an allotted deemed seat **forfeits ₹2 L**. Leaving penalties are large too, for example JSS up to ₹1.11 Cr and KIMS ₹78 L. Fill these only if you'd actually join.\n- **A Round 3 seat is final:** once you join it, you can't resign or upgrade. Put only seats you'd keep for the whole course.\n- **Missing or weak terms:** bond terms aren't published for Bhilai, Aizawl or KMC. Health City's fee isn't stated. CIHSR pays a ₹35,000 stipend, which is below the NBEMS minimum. Confirm these with the colleges.\n- **If you already hold a seat**, list only options you'd prefer to it.\n- **Keep your state counselling running as a backup**, and lock your choices well before the deadline.\n\n**What I couldn't cover:** your Round 2 result, the Round 3 dates and which of these seats will still be open in Round 3. Ask me to continue once the Round 3 seat list is out, and I'll update the list. Should I also save it as \"Ask Seatora plan\" in your [Choices](/decide/choices)? If so, tell me whether to **replace** that list or **append** to it.\n\nHistory, not a prediction."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5339,"cache_read_input_tokens":25869,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5339,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1458,"service_tier":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":112}},"parsed_output":null}}]